    {
      "id": "claim_201c0543eb144c2aacf039e5e3e0b99e",
      "statement": "The .ucw bundle/provisioning layer (src/bundle.mjs) implements three pure-ish verbs (exportBundle: vault + profile → bundle, pure; provisionBundle: bundle + params → replayable plan; importBundle: plan + engine → committed state, idempotent), with portability filtering reading the registry §5.5 classes so sale/template profiles drop tenant_private data and reduce resource_bound fields to REQUIREMENT placeholders, and import deriving its idempotency key from workspace, target path, and content digest so re-running import commits nothing.",
      "evidence": [
