      "id": "claim_be9793cc80044c2e82677d2c07aeb324",
      "statement": "The workflow runtime (src/runtime.mjs, §11.8) is a deterministic planning layer rather than a resident daemon that turns triggers into Operation Contract envelopes, and the semantic index (src/semantic.mjs, §11.9) builds a deterministic privacy-safe lexical index with link/mention edges and multilingual rendering without storing translations; both derive from vault state and neither mutates symbolic state directly.",
