      "id": "claim_c640f1be812b4cdbbea6c39f8b7f422b",
      "statement": "Transports are façades over kernel.execute and never writers: the CLI (scripts/ssss.mjs) and src/http.mjs createCommandHandler authenticate a request, parse the envelope, and forward it to the kernel, mapping symbolic error codes to HTTP status (201 commit, 200 replay/dry run, else by error code).",
