    {
      "id": "claim_df04f31b641e43bda24dfb9d772bdb26",
      "statement": "Two envelopes racing on one path are serialized by the stage-9 VFS compare-and-swap: the loser either finds a same-key winner and returns that winner's result as a replay or fails with version_conflict, and two event envelopes with the same idempotency key are serialized by the event store's uniqueness on a UUIDv5 event_id derived from workspace and key (idempotentEventId).",
