      "id": "claim_5b0b2b519b794657b4564b5f27820506",
      "statement": "An upgrade (envelope intent 'upgrade', §17.4) may not modify a tenant_private document: the kernel resolves the portability class of the target and rejects with forbidden when intent is upgrade and the class is tenant_private for non-event envelopes, so structural patches during an upgrade leave tenant-private state immutable.",
